#: accountwidget.cpp:261
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The server does not seem to support unique message numbers, but this is a "
"requirement for leaving messages on the server.\n"
"Since some servers do not correctly announce their capabilities you still "
"have the possibility to turn leaving fetched messages on the server on."
msgstr " poslužitelj čini ne seem za podrška unique poruka numbers, but ovo je requirement za leaving poruke na poslužitelj.\nOd some poslužitelji učini ne correctly announce their capabilities vi još ima possibility za turn leaving fetched poruke na poslužitelj na."

#: accountwidget.cpp:276
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Please note that this feature can cause some POP3 servers that do not "
"support pipelining to send corrupted mail;\n"
"this is configurable, though, because some servers support pipelining\n"
"but do not announce their capabilities. To check whether your POP3 server\n"
"announces pipelining support use the \"Auto Detect\" button at the bottom of "
"the dialog;\n"
"if your server does not announce it, but you want more speed, then\n"
"you should do some testing first by sending yourself a batch\n"
"of mail and downloading it."
msgstr "Molimo note to ovo feature can cause some POP3 poslužitelji to učini ne podrška pipelining za pošalji corrupted pošta;\novo je configurable, though, because some poslužitelji podrška pipelining\nbut učini ne announce their capabilities. Za provjeri whether vaš POP3 poslužitelj\nannounces pipelining podrška koristi \"Auto Detect\" button u bottom od dialog;\nako vaš poslužitelj čini ne announce to, but vi want more speed, then\nvi should učini some testing prvi putem slanje yourself batch\nod pošta i downloading to."

#: accountwidget.cpp:309
#, kde-format
msgid "Please specify a server and port on the General tab first."
msgstr "Navedite poslužitelj i priključak na General tab prvi."

#: accountwidget.cpp:342
#, kde-format
msgid "Unable to connect to the server, please verify the server address."
msgstr "Nije moguće povezati se za poslužitelj, molimo verify poslužitelj address."

#: accountwidget.cpp:386
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The server does not seem to support pipelining; therefore, this option has "
"been disabled.\n"
"Since some servers do not correctly announce their capabilities you still "
"have the possibility to turn pipelining on. But please note that this "
"feature can cause some POP servers that do not support pipelining to send "
"corrupt messages. So before using this feature with important mail you "
"should first test it by sending yourself a larger number of test messages "
"which you all download in one go from the POP server."
msgstr " poslužitelj čini ne seem za podrška pipelining; therefore, ovo mogućnost ima bio onemogućen.\nOd some poslužitelji učini ne correctly announce their capabilities vi još ima possibility za turn pipelining na. But molimo note to ovo feature can cause some POP poslužitelji to učini ne podrška pipelining za pošalji corrupt poruke. So prije koristeći ovo feature s important pošta vi should prvi test to putem slanje yourself larger broj od test poruke which vi sve preuzmi u jedan go od POP poslužitelj."

#: accountwidget.cpp:406
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The server does not seem to support unique message numbers, but this is a "
"requirement for leaving messages on the server; therefore, this option has "
"been disabled.\n"
"Since some servers do not correctly announce their capabilities you still "
"have the possibility to turn leaving fetched messages on the server on."
msgstr " poslužitelj čini ne seem za podrška unique poruka numbers, but ovo je requirement za leaving poruke na poslužitelj; therefore, ovo mogućnost ima bio onemogućen.\nOd some poslužitelji učini ne correctly announce their capabilities vi još ima possibility za turn leaving fetched poruke na poslužitelj na."

